WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching heavy punch connects in the corner.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.550
Heavy Jinrai’s delayed low continuation maintains the juggle.

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.650
The first OD Jinrai heavy follow-up extends the juggle.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.750
The second OD Jinrai heavy follow-up keeps Ryu airborne.

5
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.750
Ken juggles with running Shoryuken before the Super cancel.

6
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:12.550
Ken activates Level 3 after running Shoryuken.

7
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.750
The extended route ends in hard knockdown.
